# List & detail pages

## List page skeleton
1. Page padding: `p-4 sm:p-6` (or module layout wrapper)
2. Header: title + short description + primary CTA
3. Toolbar: search, filters (shadcn Dropdown/Select), export
4. Content: KPI cards (optional) → charts (optional) → main `Card` + `Table` or kanban
5. Create/edit via `FormModal`; delete with toast confirmation pattern used in siblings

## Detail pages
- Prefer `EntityDetailShell` / `RecordProfileDetail` / `EntityRecordTabs` under `app/CRM/`
- Route: `pages/entity/[id].js`
- Load record from `useCrmData()` or local seed by `router.query.id`
- Tabs: overview, activity, notes, related records — match Contacts/Leads detail depth when possible

## Kanban
- Copy DnD patterns from `app/Leads` or `app/Pipelines` (`@dnd-kit`)
- Keep column ids stable; sync list + board state when both exist

## Data
- Prefer `CrmDataContext` for entities shared across pages
- Local `useState(seed)` is OK for isolated demos (Analytics, Reports) — document in a one-line comment if intentional
